                {
                  "id": "h-mobile-pm",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Benefits of Mobile Truck PM Service",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "mobile-pm"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mobile-pm-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In today's trucking industry, time is everything. That's why many fleets are turning to mobile truck service options that allow maintenance to happen without taking trucks far from their routes. However, there are times when a full-service facility is still the best option, especially when technicians need advanced diagnostic tools or replacement parts on hand. At Sun State International, service centers are equipped to handle both routine maintenance and complex repairs so operators can keep their trucks performing at their best.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-how-often",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Often Should You Schedule Truck PM Service?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "how-often"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-often-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The right PM schedule depends on several factors:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-how-often-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Truck mileage"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Engine type"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Driving conditions"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Load weight"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Manufacturer recommendations"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-often-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many commercial trucks follow maintenance intervals such as:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-how-often-4",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "PM A: Every 10,000–15,000 miles"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "PM B: Every 25,000–30,000 miles"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "PM C: Major inspection at higher mileage intervals"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-often-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A dependable service team can help determine the right schedule for your truck or fleet. Staying ahead of maintenance not only protects your equipment; it also helps improve fuel efficiency, driver safety, and vehicle lifespan.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-trust-us",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Truck Owners Trust Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-trust-us"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to truck maintenance, operators want more than just a quick oil change. They want a service team that understands their equipment and respects their time. That's exactly what Sun State International delivers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With multiple locations and experienced technicians, Sun State International provides dependable support for truck owners throughout Florida. Our mission is to provide quality transportation products, parts, and services while supporting the success of every customer we serve.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For drivers and fleet owners, that means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-trust-us-4",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Straightforward service recommendations"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reliable turnaround times"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Experienced technicians who understand commercial trucks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Access to the parts needed to keep trucks moving"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "It's not just about fixing problems; it's about building long-term relationships with the operators who rely on their trucks every day.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
